{
  "title": "FactoryLens - Pipeline Health & Data Quality",
  "description": "Manufacturing ETL pipeline observability. Seven panels: pipeline stage duration, data-quality trend (dropped rows / null ratio) per line, OEE per line, LLM token usage / latency / fallback rate per provider, and streaming alerts by kind. Built from OTel spans emitted by the FactoryLens pipeline (service: factorylens).",
